OL,3,AResidents 'did not hear alarms' during
OL,4,Afatal tower fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FSome residents in an east London tower
OL,7,Fblock have said they did not hear any
OL,8,Falarms during a fire in which a man
OL,9,Fdied on the 17th floor.
OL,11,FThey told BBC London they had been
OL,12,Falerted by neighbours banging on their
OL,13,Fdoors and telling them to leave the
OL,14,Fbuilding during the early hours of
OL,15,FSaturday.
OL,17,FThe man died in the flat fire at
OL,18,FNeutron Tower in Poplar. Two adults and
OL,19,Fa child were rescued by firefighters
OL,20,Fwearing breathing apparatus, the London
OL,21,FFire Brigade (LFB) said.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,0,100
