OL,3,AResidents 'did not hear alarms' during
OL,4,Afatal tower fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FFirstPort, the building's management
OL,7,Fcompany, said "it would not be
OL,8,Fappropriate for us to speculate on
OL,9,Fspecific matters" while the fire was
OL,10,Funder investigation.
